  "idea": "Jellyfin: self-host your own private media streaming server for free",
  "text": "Here is how to access training videos and media from any device anywhere. Remote team members waste hours downloading huge video recordings locally just to watch internal onboarding tutorials. Heavy video downloads consume local drive storage and trigger frustrating format compatibility errors across machines. Jellyfin indexes your library in a clean web portal, transcoding files on the fly for smooth streaming. Your staff accesses training instantly on any screen.",
